{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1356","id":3996087804,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87uL3X8","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1356","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1356.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1356.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1356","number":1356,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[SEM-KG-HVY-15] Define mastery signal candidate contract","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1329\nParent: #1313\n\n## Summary\n\nDefines the SEM-KG-HVY-15 `MasterySignalCandidate` contract and safety boundary for future learner-model work without treating semantic KG outputs as authoritative mastery truth.\n\nThe real current semantic layer has no safe real mastery signal candidates, so the checked-in candidate layer is explicit zero-output and the safety fixture artifact proves weak semantic evidence cannot become a mastery update.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-candidate-contract.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-candidates.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-safety-fixtures.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-safety-validator.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Represented rows: 3530\n- Source layer entries: 3530\n- Source semantic assertions: 3\n- Source prerequisite candidates: 0\n- Source misconception/attempt-error candidates: 0\n- Mastery signal candidates: 0\n- Candidate signals: 0\n- Provisional signals: 0\n- Review-required signals: 0\n- Suppressed signals: 0\n- blocked_quarantined signals: 0\n- Runtime mastery updates: 0\n- Accepted mastery updates: 0\n- Safety fixtures: 5\n- Safety fixture pass/fail: 5/0\n- Validator checks: 11 pass / 0 fail\n- External model/API calls: 0\n\n## Safety Boundary\n\n- Defines allowed safety states: `candidate_signal`, `provisional_signal`, `review_required`, `suppressed`, `blocked_quarantined`.\n- There is no accepted mastery update state in this semantic KG chain.\n- Real attempt evidence is required before any future learner-model chain may update mastery.\n- Weak semantic evidence requesting mastery update is suppressed.\n- `blocked_quarantined` remains terminal regardless of confidence.\n- No learner model implementation, real student data, runtime mastery scoring, deterministic diagnosis, Supabase mutation, frontend work, external model call, or production RAG reindex.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.mjs --write` -> pass, validation_status `pass`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.test.js` -> pass, 7/7 tests\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.mjs` -> pass\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.test.js` -> pass\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-mastery-signal-contract.test.js` -> pass\n- `git diff --check` -> pass\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> warning only: branch naming and expected worktree changes before commit; workflow guards healthy\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T04:43:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T04:46:11Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T04:45:22Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T04:45:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"af1c0bdd65c943a30f9eb527f963380c23ff3d18","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1356/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1356/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1356/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/4e995c2318d2d29fc58f5820e02317bae37a8b9f","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1329","ref":"feat/issue-1329","sha":"4e995c2318d2d29fc58f5820e02317bae37a8b9f","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user